step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust baseline – the mean of all models in the full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over simple mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it improves over mean and weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled meta-model handle w1 to see if it improves over inverse_error weighting.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‐mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming extreme predictions improves over mean/weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a single best model (ARIMA) to see if a single model outperforms the combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if it improves over weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the smaller pool1 to see if a more focused subset improves over full‑pool dba.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination on the smaller pool1 using inverse_error to see if focusing on the strongest models improves over the full‑pool weighted and DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the focused pool1 to see if a robust iterative approach improves over the full‑pool DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on a slightly larger pool (pool2) to see if it beats the current best DBA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if adding ETS improves over the current best DBA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

